# Build context is the repo root for every service image (the services depend on packages/
# through file: paths, so a per-service context cannot see them). Keeping this list tight is
# what stops that decision costing a multi-hundred-megabyte context per build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
docs
benchmarks/results
evals/results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
